x86sv: SystemVerilog 8088 CPU core (rtl/) and its verification harness (verify/).

Licence terms: TBD by the maintainer. They also cover verify/suites/v20_8080 (the 8080-emulation-mode test suite,
generated by x86sv's own reference model; no third-party data).

Test data
---------
verify/ runs the SingleStepTests 8088 v2 test suite. The test data is not copied into this repository; the runner
reads it from /Work/Projects/verilator_local_files/Rodimus_Chips_MiSTer/x86/SingleStepTests_8088/v2_binary
(or $X86SV_TESTS), downloaded from https://github.com/SingleStepTests/8088. Its licence:

